I can't play ESO without Set Tracker. but the addon has been abandoned for a long time and has many errors in the latest ESO ver.
So, I have modified the original addon. and I share it.

[CODE]
Simply.

1. Delete original addons.(SetTracker & SetTracker updated)
2. Download brand-new "Set Tracker Updated" by @q.bit
3. Delete old lib files that original version has locally (Lib Stub, LibMsg, and so on)
4. Rewrite "DependOn".

It works!
by Shinntarou
[/CODE]

[B]Based on:[/B]
[URL="https://www.esoui.com/downloads/info2291-SetTracker-UPDATED.html"]SetTracker-UPDATED[/URL]

[B]How to Install[/B]

1. First, Delete original addons. (because I don't change addon's folder name. It'll conflict if the original addon exists.)
2. Install the addon by minion etc.

